This repository contains two categories of material:

  (A) SCRIPTS AND DATA — the contents of `bench/` (experiment harness scripts,
      plotting scripts, CSV data, figures) and the build/orchestration files
      under `sim/docker/` (Dockerfile, compose files, entrypoint, utility
      scripts) and `sim/run_webui.ps1`.

  (B) EXECUTABLES — the prebuilt testbed program `sim/app/sidelane-sim.jar`
      and the LK LEGO PQC library binaries under `native/` and
      `sim/docker/lib/` (`dllpqcpro.dll`, `libpqcpro_unix.so`).

